                .container
                    .hero-grid
                        .hero-left
                            h1.hero-title
                                | Hi, I'm
                                span.highlight Aynaz
                            h2.hero-subtitle AI/ML Engineer

                            p.hero-desc I develop intelligent systems with deep learning models, LLMs, RAG pipelines, AI agents, and data analysis solutions. Co-founder of 41prompts.ai. Currently building time-series models for power-grid outage prediction and forecasting.

