            // Projects Section
            section#projects.section
                .container
                    h2.section-title Projects

                    .projects-grid
                        .project-item.featured
                            .project-icon
                                i.fas.fa-globe
                            h3.project-title 41prompts.ai — Co-Founder
                            p.project-tech LLMs, RAG, AI Agents, LangChain, FastAPI, Docker, Kubernetes
                            ul.project-list
                                li Led end-to-end development of a browser-based platform delivering real-time LLM prompt optimization, evaluation, and chaining with RAG pipelines and AI agent orchestration.
                                li Architected a modular backend integrating multiple LLM providers behind a unified API for A/B testing and benchmarking, including data analysis and performance monitoring.
                                li Deployed containerized microservices on Kubernetes for scalable, low-latency inference and continuous delivery.
                            a.project-link(href='https://41prompts.ai', target='_blank') Visit Site →

                        .project-item
                            .project-icon
                                i.fas.fa-microphone
                            h3.project-title Parkinson's Disease Detection from Speech
                            p.project-tech PyTorch, SpeechBrain, Hugging Face, MFCC, Transfer Learning
                            ul.project-list
                                li Fine-tuned and benchmarked X-vector, ECAPA-TDNN, and Whisper models to classify Parkinson's Disease from voice recordings.
                                li Evaluated robustness across original and augmented datasets using MFCC features and transfer learning.

                        .project-item
                            .project-icon
                                i.fab.fa-youtube
                            h3.project-title TubeLytics: YouTube Analytics System
                            p.project-tech Java, Akka, Play Framework, CI/CD
                            ul.project-list
                                li Built a scalable analytics platform ingesting YouTube Data API streams via the actor model for high-throughput concurrent processing.
                                li Implemented unit tests and Git-hook CI to maintain code quality and prevent regressions.

